{"3456950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Gun 2", "steam_appid": 3456950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Pixel Gun 3D (300M+ players) comes a rule-breaking and reality-bending sequel. Gear up, join the fray, and outsmart your opponents in chaotic shootouts where no two matches play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXEL GUN 2 IS ALL ABOUT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced PvP shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build-driven gameplay and limitless loadout options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless cross-platform progression (PC + Mobile)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning <i>your</i> way</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every match hits different</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change is the only constant in Pixel Gun 2. The destructible map is reshaped with every shot fired, players clash with unique builds and playstyles, and you evolve during the match by stacking passive perks on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next match? Different builds. Different mayhem. Different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s exactly the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wreak havoc. Make a mess</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 maps are built to be destroyed — and creative ruination is a core part of the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls won’t protect you for long. High ground doesn’t stay safe. Camping spots disappear along with the concrete they’re standing on. Use the environment to your advantage: create new paths, flush enemies out of cover, and deal with the consequences of your “architectural adjustments.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to preserve the map. You’re here to reshape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your character. Your build. Your playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 is all about freedom of expression through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of characters, then build around them using weapons, gadgets, armor, and a deck of perks. Enhance what matters most to your setup, create powerful, tactical, or outright weird synergies, experiment with loadouts, and find combinations that work best for you — and against your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no single “right” build. The meta is meant to be questioned — and broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-platform multiplayer &amp; shared progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on PC or mobile — whenever and however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 supports cross-platform multiplayer and shared account progression. Your unlocks, rewards, and progress carry across devices with no friction. Quick sessions on mobile. Longer, more focused and competitive play on PC.<br>One account. One progression path. Same content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Pixelstorm is rising</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 is a live-service game built to evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange phenomenon known as the Pixelstorm keeps bending the rules of reality, reshaping the world and opening new possibilities — and new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/3ff4077c05a99bf43379979fe019f1e6.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/3ff4077c05a99bf43379979fe019f1e6.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/3ff4077c05a99bf43379979fe019f1e6.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expect regular updates with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new characters and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new abilities and build options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new maps, modes, and seasonal content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game grows alongside its community, constantly introducing new ways to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW AND:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be among the first to tear it up in upcoming playtests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your support and help us unleash the chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for more content to come</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump in. Break the arena. Play solo or team up with friends. Adapt, experiment, and see what happens.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Pixel Gun 3D (300M+ players) comes a rule-breaking and reality-bending sequel. Gear up, join the fray, and outsmart your opponents in chaotic shootouts where no two matches play out the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXEL GUN 2 IS ALL ABOUT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced PvP shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build-driven gameplay and limitless loadout options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless cross-platform progression (PC + Mobile)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning <i>your</i> way</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every match hits different</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change is the only constant in Pixel Gun 2. The destructible map is reshaped with every shot fired, players clash with unique builds and playstyles, and you evolve during the match by stacking passive perks on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next match? Different builds. Different mayhem. Different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s exactly the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/84970a96513092d5a41f2c3deb7e9d0d.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wreak havoc. Make a mess</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 maps are built to be destroyed — and creative ruination is a core part of the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls won’t protect you for long. High ground doesn’t stay safe. Camping spots disappear along with the concrete they’re standing on. Use the environment to your advantage: create new paths, flush enemies out of cover, and deal with the consequences of your “architectural adjustments.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to preserve the map. You’re here to reshape it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/0068597814cfe550ac22d8a50b629f74.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your character. Your build. Your playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 is all about freedom of expression through gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of characters, then build around them using weapons, gadgets, armor, and a deck of perks. Enhance what matters most to your setup, create powerful, tactical, or outright weird synergies, experiment with loadouts, and find combinations that work best for you — and against your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no single “right” build. The meta is meant to be questioned — and broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/8e29b960415ead06ba9dd5de6cb39a0b.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-platform multiplayer &amp; shared progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on PC or mobile — whenever and however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 supports cross-platform multiplayer and shared account progression. Your unlocks, rewards, and progress carry across devices with no friction. Quick sessions on mobile. Longer, more focused and competitive play on PC.<br>One account. One progression path. Same content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.webm?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/6ee33c13e45d200226682f5feb9c087e.mp4?t=1781530064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Pixelstorm is rising</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Gun 2 is a live-service game built to evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange phenomenon known as the Pixelstorm keeps bending the rules of reality, reshaping the world and opening new possibilities — and new dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/3ff4077c05a99bf43379979fe019f1e6.poster.avif?t=1781530064\" width=1170 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/extras/3f